---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import LegalPage from '../components/LegalPage.astro';
import { SOCIAL, SITE } from '../consts';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy" description={`How ${SITE.name} handles your information.`}>
  <LegalPage title="Privacy" updated="August 2026">
    <h2>The short version</h2>
    <p>
      This site does not have accounts, does not track you, and does not sell
      anything about you. The only information it collects is what you type into
      a form and send on purpose.
    </p>

    <h2>What this site collects</h2>
    <p>
      When you submit the booking, contact, or waitlist form, we receive what you
      entered — typically your name, email address, an optional phone number, and
      whatever you chose to write. It is used to reply to you and to arrange what
      you asked about. Nothing else on the site collects information about you.
    </p>
    <p>
      There is no advertising, no third-party tracking, and no cookie banner
      because there are no tracking cookies to consent to.
    </p>

    <h2>What happens elsewhere</h2>
    <p>
      Circles are sold and run on Podia, which is a separate service with its own
      privacy policy. When you join a Circle you leave this site, and Podia
      handles your account, your payment, and your access to the community and
      the recordings. Payments are never processed on this site, and card details
      never reach it.
    </p>

    <h2>What we keep, and for how long</h2>
    <p>
      Messages you send are kept for as long as needed to answer you and to keep
      a record of the arrangement. Waitlist entries are kept until the Circle you
      asked about has run, or until you ask to be removed.
    </p>

    <h2>Health information</h2>
    <p>
      Noorture consultations are consultation and education rather than medical
      care, and these forms are not a medical record system. Please do not send
      detailed health information through the website. Anything sensitive is
      better raised in the session itself.
    </p>

    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <p>
      You can ask what has been kept about you, ask for it to be corrected, or
      ask for it to be deleted. Email{' '}
      <a href={`mailto:${SOCIAL.email}`}>{SOCIAL.email}</a> and it will be
      handled.
    </p>

    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>
      This site is intended for adults caring for children. It is not directed at
      children, and it does not knowingly collect information from them.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>
      If this policy changes, the date at the top of the page changes with it.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about any of this go to{' '}
      <a href={`mailto:${SOCIAL.email}`}>{SOCIAL.email}</a>.
    </p>
  </LegalPage>
</BaseLayout>
